# No Cursor git attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or `Made with Cursor` to commits or PRs.
- Never use `git commit --trailer` for Cursor/AI attribution.
- Commits are authored only by the human repository owner.
- If a trailer was injected, remove it before finishing (amend only when safe / not pushed).
- Prefer documenting suggested commit messages for the user to run manually if attribution cannot be disabled.
